[00:20.82]1. We thank you, Jehovah, each day and each night,
[00:32.76]That you shed upon us your precious light.
[00:44.28]We thank you that we have the priv’lege of prayer,
[00:54.86]That we can approach you with ev’ry care.
[01:15.52]2. We thank you, Jehovah, for your loving Son,
[01:26.64]Who conquered the world; by his faith he won.
[01:37.66]We thank you for guidance in doing your will.
[01:49.52]You lovingly help us our vows fulfill.
[02:16.70]3. We thank you, our God, for the honor to preach
[02:27.32]About your great name and the truth to teach.
[02:40.28]We thank you that soon all earth’s woes will be past,
[02:50.72]While your Kingdom blessings forever last.
